rant no. 310000-110012/1 (to A.T.), SCORE funds 3232B0-103172 and 3200B0-103173 (to O.M.) and a grant for interdisciplinary research from the Faculty of Biology and Medicine of the University of Lausanne (to A.T. and O.M.). KZ received a postdoctoral award from the Foundation for advancement in Microbiology and Infectious Diseases. The funding agencies had no role in the design or interpretation of the study.</p></fn></fn-group></back></article>